              "value": "Noxious Breath"
            },
            "action_description": {
              "value": "The grauladon hisses and unleashes a nauseating cloud of halitosis in a 15-foot cone. Each creature in the area must succeed at a 18 Fortitude saving throw or be sickened 1 (sickened 2 on a critical failure). The grauladon can't use Noxious Breath or Reactive Breath again for 1d4 rounds."
